      "title": "radiotap: fix printing of unknown non-vendor TLVs",
      "message": "radiotap: fix printing of unknown non-vendor TLVs\n\nWhen in TLV mode, the header is already skipped so offset points\ndirectly at the data. Also, the length variable contains the length of\nthe radiotap header.\n\nFix the TLV header by using the existing add_tlv_items. For the other\nitems, adjust the offset where necessary and use the correct length.\n",
      "author_name": "Benjamin Berg",
      "author_email": "benjamin.berg@intel.com",
      "authored_date": "2025-09-18T22:54:23.000+02:00",
